{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05110","headline":"和韦舍人早朝 · 沈佺期","name":"和韦舍人早朝","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"阊阖连云起，岩廊拂雾开。\n玉珂龙影度，珠履雁行来。\n长乐宵钟尽，明光晓奏催。\n一经推旧德，五字擢英才。\n俨若神仙去，纷从霄汉廻。\n千春奉休历，分禁喜趋陪。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"沈佺期","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05110.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05110","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}